summary:
  The first "I:" in ffmpeg's log is printed as the reading.

history:
  With the frame log on, every tenth of a second carries the running figure.
  Five seconds in it was up to 6.3 dB off the station's loudness.

target:
  package/contents/ui/loudness.py

find:
  _SUMMARY = re.compile(r"Summary:\s+Integrated loudness:\s+I:\s+(-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?) LUFS")

replace:
  _SUMMARY = re.compile(r"I:\s+(-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?) LUFS")

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_loudness.py::test_a_frames_line_is_not_the_answer.
  Line-neutral.
